 Lamassu","El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/concepts/overview",{"_77":85},"platform/concepts/overview.mdx",{"_52":87,"_59":70,"_54":88,"_64":89,"_73":-7,"_10":90,"_75":91},"es:platform/concepts/architecture.mdx","Arquitectura de la plataforma","Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/concepts/architecture",{"_77":92},"platform/concepts/architecture.mdx",{"_59":60,"_54":94,"_62":-7,"_63":-7,"_64":-7,"_66":-7,"_56":95,"_52":207,"_75":208,"_73":211,"_212":213},"PKI",[96,100,105,110,117,122,125,130,137,140,147,154,161,168,173,176,183,190,197,200],{"_52":97,"_59":98,"_73":-7,"_54":99},"es:_0","separator","Primeros pasos",{"_52":101,"_59":70,"_54":40,"_64":102,"_73":-7,"_10":39,"_75":103},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/overview.mdx","Crea una CA, emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba su cadena y su clave.",{"_77":104},"platform/pki/quickstarts/overview.mdx",{"_52":106,"_59":70,"_54":37,"_64":107,"_73":-7,"_10":36,"_75":108},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx","Crea una raíz de evaluación y comprueba su certificado antes de emitir.",{"_77":109},"platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx",{"_52":111,"_59":70,"_54":112,"_64":113,"_73":-7,"_10":114,"_75":115},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx","Emite y verifica un certificado","Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_77":116},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_52":118,"_59":70,"_54":43,"_64":119,"_73":-7,"_10":42,"_75":120},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/revoke-certificate.mdx","Revoca un certificado entre los muchos emitidos por una CA y confirma que su CRL lo incluye.",{"_77":121},"platform/pki/quickstarts/revoke-certificate.mdx",{"_52":123,"_59":98,"_73":-7,"_54":124},"es:_1"