-hierarchy-and-rotation",{"_77":167},"platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx",{"_52":169,"_59":70,"_54":31,"_64":170,"_73":-7,"_10":30,"_75":171},"es:platform/pki/certificates.mdx","Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu.",{"_77":172},"platform/pki/certificates.mdx",{"_52":174,"_59":98,"_73":-7,"_54":175},"es:_3","Validación",{"_52":177,"_59":70,"_54":178,"_64":179,"_73":-7,"_10":180,"_75":181},"es:platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx","Validación de certificados","Comprueba cadena, identidad, usos y revocación desde el consumidor.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation",{"_77":182},"platform/pki/certificate-validation.mdx",{"_52":184,"_59":70,"_54":185,"_64":186,"_73":-7,"_10":187,"_75":188},"es:platform/pki/ocsp.mdx","OCSP","Consulta el estado firmado y verifica la respuesta del respondedor.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/ocsp",{"_77":189},"platform/pki/ocsp.mdx",{"_52":191,"_59":70,"_54":192,"_64":193,"_73":-7,"_10":194,"_75":195},"es:platform/pki/crl.mdx","CRL","Genera y distribuye listas firmadas para validar certificados sin conexión.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/crl",{"_77":196},"platform/pki/crl.mdx",{"_52":198,"_59":98,"_73":-7,"_54":199},"es:_4","Resolución de problemas",{"_52":201,"_59":70,"_54":202,"_64":203,"_73":-7,"_10":204,"_75":205},"es:platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas PKI","Diagnostica emisión de certificados, OCSP y CRL.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting",{"_77":206},"platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/pki",{"_209":210},"metaFile","platform/pki/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c